# Work queue of the agents as REST (OperationsService, /rest/service/operations)
#
# The operations service is served with two protocols: OData V4 at /service/operations and plain
# REST at /rest/service/operations. REST returns plain JSON (a list is an array, errors are
# { "error": { "message", "code" } }), reads an entity at /<Entity>/<key> and calls bound actions
# and functions at /<Entity>/<key>/<name>. The users are the mocked users (the password is the
# user name). Run the requests top down; start the app with `npm run cds-watch`.

@host = http://localhost:4004

### List of the entities of the service
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Open messages, filtered, sorted and limited with the OData query options
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages?$filter=status%20eq%20'Open'&$orderby=customerMessageID&$top=3&$select=ID,customerMessageID,customerName
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### One message by its key
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### A message that does not exist
# expect: 404
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Suggested priority (bound function)
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96/suggestedPriority
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Statistics (unbound function)
# expect: 200
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/statistics
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer

### Add a reply (bound action)
# expect: 200
POST {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96/addReply
Authorization: Basic agent agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Support Team",
  "text": "Thank you, we have noted the problem with the drainage."
}

### The author and the text are mandatory
# expect: 400
POST {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96/addReply
Authorization: Basic agent agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Support Team"
}

### Resolve the message (bound action)
# expect: 200
POST {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96/markAsResolved
Authorization: Basic agent agent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution": "Drain cleaned during the next visit"
}

### Resolving it again fails
# expect: 409
POST {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages/e522550f-ac79-40ab-82f9-fdebf97d9a96/markAsResolved
Authorization: Basic agent agent
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Without credentials the request is refused
# expect: 401
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages

### A login without a role is refused
# expect: 403
GET {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages
Authorization: Basic stranger stranger

### The entities are read-only
# expect: 405
POST {{host}}/rest/service/operations/CustomerMessages
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerMessageID": 9002
}
